         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Us and Them\n\nTo give names to our fingers, but to write a name, it is necessary to speak that name.\n\nThe voice is also something very old and that did not arise with us.\n\nIn this lesson, we will see the difference between our voice and the voice of other animals.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
