         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### I Also Have a Voice\n\nWe are not the only animals (yes, we are animals and we will see this in more detail later). This happens with animals close to us, that is, that look like us, such as the chimpanzee in the picture. Or animals that are more distant — they do not look like us — but they live with us, like cats.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown/html/text",
               "PostMention": ""
