         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Same, but Different\n\nEven though many animals have a voice, as far as we know, speech with distinction of sounds is something only we have. This allows us, among other things, to give names to the fingers of our hands and to ourselves.\n\nAnd giving names is not the only activity we can do with that speech; it also allows us to transmit different knowledge to other people.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "521e3dff-a3a4-454e-a1fc-077e41228ddc",
