        "source_menu": [],
        "text": [
          {
            "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this lesson, we learned that we are not the only animals that have a voice. In addition, we saw the difference between our voice and that of other animals.\n\nSince we are still in the first lessons, we did not go into the details of the reasons why we have a type of speech that other animals do not have. This will be taught as our knowledge grows.",
            "source": [],
            "date_time": null,
            "isTable": false,
            "imgdesc": "",
            "format": "markdown",
            "PostMention": ""
          }
